<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Flash sales</h2>
<p>For flash sales, audit consent capture and purchase-event suppression before the first flow goes live — every app must record flash sales opt-ins you can evidence and halt promos at checkout. For flash sales, a promo arriving after a purchase, refund, or open support case burns trust faster than weak flash sales creative ever could.</p>
